{"counts":{"canonical":23,"context":0,"total":23,"unknown_date":0,"unlinked":0},"events":[{"aliases":["Archaeological Site of Mehrgarh","泥砖","聚落"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-bf2f7311a77f802426eb3684","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-bf2f7311a77f802426eb3684","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5772d60dd6f8b81bb35ec734","summary":"梅赫尔格尔位于今巴基斯坦俾路支省的卡奇平原，靠近博兰山口和博兰河。这里保存了跨公元前第七至第三千纪的长期考古序列，地层深逾十一米。多代居民反复营建泥砖建筑，旧屋遗存被新建筑覆盖，逐渐累积成今天看到的聚落土丘。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前第七至第三千纪","end_year":-2001,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-7000},"title":"梅赫尔格尔群体连续营建泥砖聚落"},{"aliases":["Early Plains Archaic","食物","环境适应"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["北美大平原"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-4070732f6deb2a7d3d2c2708","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-4070732f6deb2a7d3d2c2708","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-8f147befdcb86f09bb7979b3","summary":"约公元前5600至前3000年，北美大平原早期古风时期的人群仍大量依赖野牛，同时更常利用鱼类、鸟类和浆果。当地生计并非始终不变：早期猎人已经发展出步行协作驱赶猎物及使用投射工具的办法，河谷和草原的不同资源也共同进入食物来源。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5600年—公元前3000年","end_year":-3000,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5600},"title":"北美大平原早期古风时期的食物利用"},{"aliases":["Chinchorro","丧葬","遗体处理"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["钦乔罗文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-6abcf6ce3331b30f63ffec6d","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-6abcf6ce3331b30f63ffec6d","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5497db2bba26e3b36f16fc2b","summary":"钦乔罗文化的海洋狩猎采集群体，约在公元前5450至前890年生活于今智利北部干旱的阿塔卡马沿海。海洋资源是其生计的重要基础，遗址中发现用骨、贝壳以及矿物和植物材料制作的工具，也保存了格外复杂的葬俗证据。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5450—前890年","end_year":-890,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5450},"title":"钦乔罗海洋采集群体发展人工木乃伊葬俗"},{"aliases":["Kitakogane Site","渔业","贝丘","居住"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["绳纹文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-4ef0cd76f93ea5148e1ddd8f","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-4ef0cd76f93ea5148e1ddd8f","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-ed76ae8247c548adbfb267a6","summary":"北黄金遗址位于北海道西南部内浦湾东岸的台地，考古范围约从公元前5000年延续至前2000年。聚落包含竖穴住居、墓葬、贝丘和用水地点。大量贝壳、鱼骨与海兽骨表明，当地居民充分利用沿海水域，以捕鱼和其他海洋资源获取为重要生计。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000—前2000年","end_year":-2000,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"北黄金居民以渔业为重要生计并营建聚落"},{"aliases":["人面鱼纹彩陶盆","彩陶","图像"],"body":[],"categories":["艺术","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-f2285c47e34d4ce2713c9acb","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-f2285c47e34d4ce2713c9acb","record_type":"work","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-ac86e5c4cd7aa0d4b198e69e","summary":"半坡人面鱼纹彩陶盆以红色陶胎和黑彩构成鲜明对比：盆内壁绘有两组相对的人面鱼纹，鱼的头部和人嘴轮廓彼此结合，另有鱼纹穿插其间。人物的眼、鼻及头部装饰被简化为明确的线条，使自然形象转化成带有想象力的装饰构图。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000—前3000年","end_year":-3000,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"year_range","start_year":-5000},"title":"半坡人面鱼纹彩陶盆"},{"aliases":["transitional period","农业","城市起源"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["印度河文明"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-acead5667bb162fd5c75046c","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-acead5667bb162fd5c75046c","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-cdef436efdb8ba9b018a1331","summary":"约公元前5000至前2600年，印度河地区的一些农业聚落逐渐扩大，呈现从村落迈向城镇的变化。考古发现中，住宅和道路的布局更为清楚，聚落也常靠近适于耕作的土地或便利交换的地点。相似器物在较大区域内出现，反映不同社区之间的联系不断增多。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000年—公元前2600年","end_year":-2600,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"印度河地区迈向城市文明"},{"aliases":["Prehistoric Pile Dwellings around the Alps","居住建筑","环境利用"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-843c3d0b25516b22aa225af7","summary":"约公元前5000至前500年，阿尔卑斯及周边人群在湖岸、河边和湿地附近营建桩上聚落。列入世界遗产的系列包含多个国家的一百余处遗址，记录了新石器时代至青铜时代不同群体的居住方式。它们不是一座持续存在的城市，而是一组跨越漫长时期的聚落材料。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000—前500年","end_year":-500,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"阿尔卑斯周边群体营建水边桩上聚落"},{"aliases":["Yangshao (painted pottery) culture","考古","制陶"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["黄河流域新石器文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-9cbeae08566b87e98af368ec","images":[],"map_reference":{"checked_at":"2026-10-25","kind":"region_reference","label":"黄河","latitude":36.12419444444444,"license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/","longitude":116.09766666666667,"note":"本条所引原文明确涉及黄河；地图采用资料支持的地点范围，不表示精确场址或完整路线。 地理补录不代表整条史实已经终审。","precision":"region","role":"材料涉及地点","source_title":"Wikidata Q7355 · P625","source_url":"https://www.wikidata.org/w/index.php?title=Q7355&oldid=2541774085"},"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-9cbeae08566b87e98af368ec","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-3db213eb11777bf0eb2fa84d","summary":"约公元前5000至前3000年，黄河中游分布着以彩陶和村落遗存著称的仰韶文化。考古学家通过陶器形制、纹饰以及房屋、墓葬的组合辨认不同遗址的联系。大量粟作村落、石制工具和制作精细的陶器，显示当地人群已经形成较稳定的农业生活。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000年—公元前3000年","end_year":-3000,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"黄河中游的仰韶文化"},{"aliases":["Neolithic Flint Mines of Spiennes","采矿","燧石"],"body":[],"categories":["科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-3018b66a9fc5ba7f72da3494","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-3018b66a9fc5ba7f72da3494","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-4e1b20bbc314b8c6922d89c2","summary":"斯皮耶纳位于今比利时蒙斯附近，约从公元前第五千纪后段至第三千纪上半叶形成密集的地下燧石开采活动。新石器时代矿工通过竖井下到地层，再沿地下巷道接近石料。部分竖井深达十六米，反映他们已经能够针对不同石层安排复杂的取材办法。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前第五千纪末三分之一至第三千纪上半叶","end_year":-2501,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-4333},"title":"斯皮耶纳群体开采地下燧石矿"},{"aliases":["Norte Chico","灌溉","农业"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["安第斯北奇科地区"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-9f5890c5322f6aac42561e18","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"Norte Chico","precision":"named_place","role":"source_mentioned_place"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-9f5890c5322f6aac42561e18","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-1b17a84b18a7f3571edb9d8a","summary":"安第斯沿海腹地约公元前4000至前3000年的修渠活动，被所引教材放在海岸与内陆社区交换的背景中讨论。沿海遗址既留有棉制渔网，也出现来自内陆的产品，说明不同生态区的人群之间存在物品往来；水渠可能是这种关系中的一项共同工程。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前4000年—公元前3000年","end_year":-3000,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-4000},"title":"安第斯沿海腹地修建水渠"},{"aliases":["Naqada culture","彩陶"],"body":[],"categories":["艺术","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["前王朝埃及"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-fcdc55e0fb80c372534bf829","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-fcdc55e0fb80c372534bf829","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-4f283875d83e50da67d159f3","summary":"涅伽达文化陶器留下了埃及王朝形成前丰富的装饰材料。这类文化遗存中，可见碗、瓶、罐等不同器形，表面绘有波浪、植物和人物等图案。这些纹样使陶器既具有储存等生活用途，也成为观察当时形象表达的重要载体。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前4000—前3000年","end_year":-3000,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"period","start_year":-4000},"title":"涅伽达文化陶器绘制波浪与人物纹样"},{"aliases":["Megalithic Temples of Malta","巨石建筑"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-7c00599f2172bee57df0df8f","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-7c00599f2172bee57df0df8f","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-3c2e3ca3b2fa74f46abc623c","summary":"公元前第四至第三千纪，马耳他及戈佐岛的建造者用本地石材营建巨石庙。建筑常由立起的石板、上部横石、铺地庭院及沿中轴两侧展开的半圆形房间组成，各处平面与构造又有所不同。这些遗存表明，建造者能够根据石材性质和空间需求安排大型结构。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前第四至第三千纪","end_year":-2001,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"period","start_year":-4000},"title":"马耳他建造者以本地石材营建巨石庙"},{"aliases":["Ħal Saflieni Hypogeum","丧葬","地下建筑"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-2e3ec6f1aabad8fb48945046","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-2e3ec6f1aabad8fb48945046","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-d5868ee503eb91df232a75c6","summary":"哈尔萨夫列尼地下墓地位于今马耳他保拉，约从公元前4000至前2500年持续使用。人们使用燧石、黑曜石等石质工具和鹿角，在较软的石灰岩中凿出上下叠置的三层洞室。最早的上层由山坡开入，之后更多侧室和下层空间逐渐加入。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前4000—前2500年","end_year":-2500,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-4000},"title":"马耳他群体使用哈尔萨夫列尼地下墓地"},{"aliases":["Sannai Maruyama Site","聚落规划","居住建筑"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["绳纹文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-72d9bdfeb2425fd15adcdd63","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-72d9bdfeb2425fd15adcdd63","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-25dfe157a9b45cbe1e66db48","summary":"三内丸山遗址位于今日本青森，约公元前3900至前2200年的材料呈现一处大型绳文聚落。竖穴住居、柱支建筑、成列墓葬、储藏坑、道路和人工土丘具有一定规划关系。大量陶器、石器，以及栗、核桃和鱼兽骨骼，显示居民利用河口、内湾和森林的多种资源。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3900—前2200年","end_year":-2200,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-3900},"title":"三内丸山居民按规划布置大型聚落"},{"aliases":["Stonehenge, Avebury and Associated Sites","巨石建筑","葬俗"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-43cecb4a48bf8b2c4103592d","images":[{"caption":"巨石阵现存遗迹，Diego Delso于2014年摄影。","creator":"Diego Delso","credit":"Diego Delso / Wikimedia Commons / CC BY-SA 4.0","depiction_type":"modern_site_photograph","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","obligations":["保留作者、来源和许可证链接。","如改编图像，注明修改并以相同或兼容许可分享改编图像。","不对图像另加与本许可冲突的使用限制。"],"rights_revision_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File%3AStonehenge%2C+Condado+de+Wiltshire%2C+Inglaterra%2C+2014-08-12%2C+DD+09.JPG&oldid=1285433761","sha256":"d2c6f7394b6cc04109e8a8eaa0ad1e0061c239f3897b25da545d11f93386375f","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Stonehenge,_Condado_de_Wiltshire,_Inglaterra,_2014-08-12,_DD_09.JPG","src":"/api/history/assets/AS-d2c6f7394b6cc04109e8a8eaa0ad1e0061c239f3897b25da545d11f93386375f.jpg"}],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-43cecb4a48bf8b2c4103592d","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-2a8e8317c58e269b1e5f1be8","summary":"约公元前3700至前1600年，今英国威尔特郡的巨石阵、埃夫伯里及周边地区持续营建和使用仪式性景观。这里不只有著名石圈，还包括大道、围沟、木构遗迹和多种墓葬。石材与土方建筑之间的位置关系，显示不同世代不断改变并重新利用同一地区。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3700—前1600年","end_year":-1600,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-3700},"title":"巨石阵与埃夫伯里地区营建并使用仪式景观"},{"aliases":["来源未给独立事件专名；据所列遗址、器物或行动描述拟题。","聚落","台湾史前史"],"body":[],"categories":["文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-5d81c6ee9b97692db3883faa","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-5d81c6ee9b97692db3883faa","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-48e275a7bcc0d9c06c69b528","summary":"约公元前3500至前2000年，台湾新石器时代的聚落数量和规模出现明显变化。所引研究汇集淡水河流域、台湾东部及其他地区的遗址资料，指出一些地方从早期少数聚落发展到中期数十处聚落，部分中期遗址的面积也远大于早期遗址。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3500—前2000年","end_year":-2000,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-3500},"title":"台湾新石器时代的人口扩展阶段"},{"aliases":["来源未给独立事件专名；据所列遗址、器物或行动描述拟题。","高原农业","家畜","彩陶"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-6b230cc95c2f92dcfc0b5932","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-6b230cc95c2f92dcfc0b5932","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-db6a9404168fc51bc82a9d82","summary":"昌都卡若遗址位于青藏高原，所引研究将相关材料置于约公元前3500至前2200年。遗址中见有家猪、彩陶以及粟、黍等谷物，为讨论高原早期居民的动物饲养和作物利用提供实物证据。这些材料也使卡若能够同四川西部等地区的史前遗存比较。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3500—前2200年","end_year":-2200,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-3500},"title":"昌都卡若的家猪遗存"},{"aliases":["Jade Ritual Dragon Figure","玉器","礼仪"],"body":[],"categories":["艺术","宗教"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-1fb7ec35249beb83415cdeea","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-1fb7ec35249beb83415cdeea","record_type":"work","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-19bf93ff7d5589c1e42e288b","summary":"牛河梁红山文化遗址出土的龙形玉器，是认识史前象生玉雕及礼仪活动的重要材料。遗址中还发现祭坛、女神庙、积石冢，以及以凤、人等为题材的玉器群。把器物放回这些建筑和墓葬关系中，可以讨论玉器在当时社会中承担的角色，而不只把它当作一件装饰艺术品。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3500—前3000年","end_year":-3000,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"year_range","start_year":-3500},"title":"牛河梁的红山文化玉龙形礼器"},{"aliases":["Pendant in the form of a mask","玉器","佩饰"],"body":[],"categories":["艺术"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-24be62d3609fac74eaf95229","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-24be62d3609fac74eaf95229","record_type":"work","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-a64ca20bd2ca8b44bfe329f1","summary":"这件约公元前3500至前3000年的红山文化面具形玉佩，是一块很薄的灰绿色玉片。对称钻孔形成眼睛，上方有弧形槽，底缘排列齿状突起，两侧又有卷曲形部件。正面以浅浮雕强调轮廓，背面则较平整，器物中间另有适于悬挂的穿孔。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3500—前3000年","end_year":-3000,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"year_range","start_year":-3500},"title":"红山文化面具形玉佩"},{"aliases":["来源未给独立事件专名；据所列遗址、器物或行动描述拟题。","城市","稻作","水利"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-93b17d91c328ecf3effb809c","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-93b17d91c328ecf3effb809c","record_type":"site","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-4bf099f668e849e85fc33749","summary":"约公元前3300至前2300年的良渚古城遗址，呈现长江下游以稻作农业为重要支撑的早期复杂社会。遗产范围包括城址、瑶山遗址以及谷口高坝、平原低坝等区域。大型土质建筑、城市规划和水利设施，使居住空间、生产基础与公共营建能够作为整体考察。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3300—前2300年","end_year":-2300,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-3300},"title":"良渚古城及其稻作社会"},{"aliases":["The Origins of Writing","文字","记账"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["两河流域"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-30da18528bd1aa7e9ac6a32f","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-30da18528bd1aa7e9ac6a32f","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-9bbe13a59c92ec212be01520","summary":"约公元前3200至前3000年的早期楔形文字中，已经出现少量借音表意的用例。一个图像符号可以不只表示所画的物体，还借用与它相同或相近的声音来表达另一含义。这种办法使书写有机会超出直接描画谷物、鱼类和动物等可见对象的范围。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3200—前3000年","end_year":-3000,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"period","start_year":-3200},"title":"早期楔形文字出现借音表意的用法"},{"aliases":["石家河聚落群","城市","制陶","祭祀"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技","宗教"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-db0cff912750b1685e1ab8d6","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-db0cff912750b1685e1ab8d6","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-ba1114f1738518d5c017ed5c","summary":"石家河遗址群的制陶和祭祀材料，显示大型聚落内部并非只有住宅。三房湾发现陶窑、洗泥池、蓄水缸以及数摞套叠烧结的陶杯，支持这里存在专业制陶活动的判断。相关窑场在石家河文化晚期发展，并延续至后石家河阶段，不宜把全部遗迹定为同时出现。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3200—前2200年","end_year":-2200,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-3200},"title":"石家河聚落的制陶和祭祀活动"},{"aliases":["来源未给独立事件专名；据所列遗址、器物或行动描述拟题。","稻田","土地利用"],"body":[],"categories":["科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-c2385cc7c8b7407249cfa7ea","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-c2385cc7c8b7407249cfa7ea","record_type":"site","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-ea959246f3ca607f3d3bb8ee","summary":"茅山良渚时期稻田的田埂，提供了观察史前农业空间的具体材料。所引综述把有关田地置于约公元前3200至前2400年，描述长条形田块由较长、相互平行的田埂分开。这比单纯发现稻粒更进一步，让研究者能够讨论居民怎样划分和经营实际耕作地面。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3200—前2400年","end_year":-2400,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-3200},"title":"茅山稻田的田埂"}],"revision":"16e2d9bc7dac753e8ae63fc6d7d5464fd2e2ef9bb6dc2e0855171d4b9b35d835","schema_version":"1.0.0","scope":"public_database","sources":[],"time_bounds":{"max_year":2026,"min_year":-10000}}